# graphviz's render() writes the DOT source alongside the .svg, with no
# extension (tutorials/iris/iris_model, .../iris_pruned_model, ...). Ignore
# those build artifacts; the rendered *.svg diagrams are kept, since the
# pattern only matches names *ending* in _model.
